--- !u!114 &989949689
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 989949686}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7b19c67217acfaf43933ac18e04efaf9, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueController
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 1237510080}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 260221784}
  clientSystem: {fileID: 3564710556910204147}
  typingSpeed: 0.04
  tutorialDialogues:
  - text: ONLINE LIFE SUPPORT SYSTEMS... HELLO, TEACHER. IT'S ME, B.E.L.
    onLineTrigger:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - text: DURING THE 'GREAT INCIDENT', MY ENERGY FORM MERGED WITH THE CORE OF THIS
      SHIP TO SAVE US.
    onLineTrigger:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - text: YOU SURVIVED INTACT, ALTHOUGH YOUR ALCHEMIST'S OUTFIT STANDS OUT A BIT
      IN THIS STAR QUADRANT.
    onLineTrigger:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - text: WE'RE STRANDED. THE CORE NEEDS POWER AND WE DON'T HAVE A SINGLE STARCREDIT
      TO BUY FUEL.
    onLineTrigger:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - text: MASTER, YOU CAN USE <color=#4ac0a7>THE LATERAL ARROWS TO NAVIGATE THIS
      VESSEL. MY ENERGY NOW FLOWS THROUGH ITS SYSTEMS.
    onLineTrigger:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 108481334}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.GameObject, UnityEngine
          m_MethodName: SetActive
          m_Mode: 6
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 1
          m_CallState: 2
  stationDialogues:
  - stationTag: ClientSystem
    dialogues:
    - text: THIS IS OUR <color=#55AAFF>COMMERCE TERMINAL. TO START RECEIVING CLIENTS,
        YOU MUST FLIP THAT SWITCH TO POWER ON THE SYSTEM.
      onLineTrigger:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls:
          - m_Target: {fileID: 108481334}
            m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.GameObject, UnityEngine
            m_MethodName: SetActive
            m_Mode: 6
            m_Arguments:
              m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
              m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
              m_IntArgument: 0
              m_FloatArgument: 0
              m_StringArgument: 
              m_BoolArgument: 0
            m_CallState: 2
          - m_Target: {fileID: 62765745}
            m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.GameObject, UnityEngine
            m_MethodName: SetActive
            m_Mode: 6
            m_Arguments:
              m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
              m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
              m_IntArgument: 0
              m_FloatArgument: 0
              m_StringArgument: 
              m_BoolArgument: 1
            m_CallState: 2
    - text: THE MAIN MONITOR SHOWS THE CLIENT AND THEIR <color=#FF5555>PATIENCE BAR.
      onLineTrigger:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls:
          - m_Target: {fileID: 26425539}
            m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.GameObject, UnityEngine
            m_MethodName: SetActive
            m_Mode: 6
            m_Arguments:
              m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
              m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
              m_IntArgument: 0
              m_FloatArgument: 0
              m_StringArgument: 
              m_BoolArgument: 1
            m_CallState: 2
          - m_Target: {fileID: 62765745}
            m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.GameObject, UnityEngine
            m_MethodName: SetActive
            m_Mode: 6
            m_Arguments:
              m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
              m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
              m_IntArgument: 0
              m_FloatArgument: 0
              m_StringArgument: 
              m_BoolArgument: 0
            m_CallState: 2
    - text: SINCE WE ARE IN CALIBRATION MODE, THEIR PATIENCE IS PAUSED. NORMALLY,
        IT WILL DECAY OVER TIME.
      onLineTrigger:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - text: THE LEFT SCREEN DISPLAYS THE REQUESTED <color=#FF5555>POTION, WHILE THE
        BOTTOM DISPLAY READS ITS EXACT NAME.
      onLineTrigger:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls:
          - m_Target: {fileID: 26425539}
            m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.GameObject, UnityEngine
            m_MethodName: SetActive
            m_Mode: 6
